 ('rang','own',5,'Reflexive emphasis only, excluding the possessive his.'),
 ('gi',None,6,'Genitive is fused into the English possessive his; no separately alignable genitive token.'),
 ('blos rlom pa','imagination',5,'Established master-attested expression; do not split off blo as a second mind word.'),
 ('tsam','nothing more than',6,'Limiting particle carries the entire restrictive expression.'),
