 ("pa'i",None,6,'Nominal-genitive link to phyir, realized by the causal construction without a separate token.'),
 ('phyir','because',6,'Causal particle; English order places it before the reason.')
],"The complete response formula and body-washing recast are d3. The second mi is pronominalized in his and stays omitted; rang owns only own. The copula yin is fused into it's (null does not mean its meaning is absent). The supplied with the water stays unwrapped. Closing zer na is distributed into the opening claim frame and omitted. Full GMR English is unchanged.",[
 {'tib':'la','occurrence':2,'reason':'Topic/experiencer construction is recast as When the human; no independent case mapping is claimed.'},
 {'tib':'de mi','reason':'Referent and human are distributed into it\'s and his; no standalone lexical pair is defensible.'},
 {'tib':'zer na','reason':'Closing hypothetical quotation frame is realized with the opening English claim formula; omitted rather than false-null.'},
